                    {
                        "sense_id": "93e0e76c-48fd-3c6d-b531-1f3c7be70f89",
                        "entry_id": "a9bf8c2b-e220-369e-ba1d-98a484daf9aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "overgang of omschakeling"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b9ca7a2-9a6a-4b4a-9fbb-e039d261a0b9",
                                "sense_id": "93e0e76c-48fd-3c6d-b531-1f3c7be70f89",
                                "text": "De transitie naar duurzame energie verliep niet zonder slag of stoot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c625dc7f-529c-4bc2-acac-d3f8102070f9",
                                "sense_id": "93e0e76c-48fd-3c6d-b531-1f3c7be70f89",
                                "text": "De vraag is of we nu zo’n hegemoniale transitie beleven en of Trump en Poetin verstandige staatslieden genoemd kunnen worden. Dat laatste beslist NIET, al was het maar omdat ze zichzelf onfeilbaar vinden, maar van een hegemoniale transitie lijkt me wel degelijk sprake."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0a5a4f1b-2e06-4323-8d1a-a34cbbcbcbdb",
                        "source_entry_id": "a9bf8c2b-e220-369e-ba1d-98a484daf9aa",
                        "source_sense_id": "93e0e76c-48fd-3c6d-b531-1f3c7be70f89",
                        "source_sense_description": "structurele overgang of omschakeling",
                        "target_lang_word": "transition",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "transition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a39d5b7f-2b60-3945-a815-d60e6af2d7d2",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of change from one form, state, style or place to another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3eea41b-3344-4c8a-9e88-1bc1afdd7b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "a39d5b7f-2b60-3945-a815-d60e6af2d7d2",
                                                "text": "All this was extraordinarily distasteful to Churchill.[…]Never before had he felt such repulsion when the vicar displayed his characteristic bluntness or coarseness of speech. In the present connexion—or rather as a transition from the subject that started their conversation—such talk had been distressingly out of place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0e14aa7-a4fe-4048-b790-09d47c70f0c1",
                                                "sense_id": "a39d5b7f-2b60-3945-a815-d60e6af2d7d2",
                                                "text": "In a period of transition from steam to diesel, many of the schemes are inevitably of an interim nature and only on full dieselisation will the final pattern be determined and full benefit derived."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fc2fcaf-bbe2-4221-bf3b-0272c03ed1b5",
                                                "sense_id": "a39d5b7f-2b60-3945-a815-d60e6af2d7d2",
                                                "text": "So, depending on how he chooses to govern over the next four years, Mr. Obama may yet have a chance to reset the stale debate in Washington, or at least to hasten the transition from one moment to the next. His re-election opens the door further for the post-’60s generation, even if it does not quite clear the room."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c552ed4-4431-3440-afdc-dada75f9ec21",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A word or phrase connecting one part of a discourse to another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffd95496-cf60-4ba5-8261-f8ae28eab835",
                                                "sense_id": "3c552ed4-4431-3440-afdc-dada75f9ec21",
                                                "text": "Holonym: metadiscourse"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0abee42f-0ead-315a-84a1-7c7241a7cf47",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brief modulation; a passage connecting two themes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92389e2d-edce-3d4f-893e-4aa092ec8abc",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A change of key."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
