                                        "sense_id": "b8ef547d-38c7-3f87-b7d2-19de63fb2626",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A point mutation in which one base is replaced by another of the same class (purine or pyrimidine); compare transversion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98dbfb65-823c-375c-b998-ae2f26d0f498",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A change from defense to attack, or attack to defense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "312e17ee-1645-395b-874a-a1b6d60d7b78",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The onset of the final stage of childbirth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f02ebe13-999a-366c-a2a5-7bffa66b2a09",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Professional special education assistance for children or adults in the process of leaving one educational environment or support program for another to relatively more independent living."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3422e1d-a031-377d-b4e9-bd969acb80a4",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A change between forward and backward motion without stopping."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a0fba88-1507-36f2-8289-8ad1840774ca",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process or act of changing one's gender role or physical and sexual characteristics, by social, medical, or legal methods, to conform to their identified gender, rather than the sex assigned at birth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa1f80e3-0f14-4362-b8b6-7e4e29ab2ef0",
                                                "sense_id": "7a0fba88-1507-36f2-8289-8ad1840774ca",
                                                "text": "The preoccupation with transition and surgery objectifies trans people. And then we don't get to really deal with the real lived experiences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad793b80-3a9f-427d-a278-7843279258aa",
                                                "sense_id": "7a0fba88-1507-36f2-8289-8ad1840774ca",
                                                "text": "The LED lights up her face as she watches the YouTube video of a goth girl in New Orleans again. Nobody could tell to look at her. She has a year-long film of her transition and at the end of it she has black lips and long hair and she is hot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f973c4a-4074-4ef5-910b-c8f94094cf88",
                                                "sense_id": "7a0fba88-1507-36f2-8289-8ad1840774ca",
                                                "text": "When trans young people talk about their own transition, usually they mean using a different name and pronouns from the ones given to them at birth, and adapting their gender presentation to better express themselves, while asking that others (particularly family members, peers and teachers) acknowledge this presentation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2181eadd-b174-3818-82f8-43bc6911574d",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A published procedure for instrument flight, coming between the departure and en-route phases of flight, or between en-route flight and an approach/landing procedure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62fc2f97-40ab-3365-9456-0f58cb7a075c",
                                        "entry_id": "43018148-b4b6-31f7-bdaf-4e55dd7b4f9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Death; passing from life into death."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8c4515c-9549-40aa-aabf-a4ce69886523",
                                                "sense_id": "62fc2f97-40ab-3365-9456-0f58cb7a075c",
                                                "text": "As I read for the first time the inscription on my ancestor's tombstone, I recognized her name, but it was the date that transfixed my gaze and made my hair stand on end. The date of her death was March 1st, a fact I had been unaware of, but I did know that this day happened also to be March 1st; it was the thirty-second anniversary of her transition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5252711-8d8c-47e2-8d65-7a2d28be5915",
                                                "sense_id": "62fc2f97-40ab-3365-9456-0f58cb7a075c",
                                                "text": "This was my first Christmas without Gemmia and the one-year anniversary of her transition. […] We had a lovely time, but it was very clear that we would rather have been home doing what we would have done had Gemmia been alive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "transition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28af86ed-9324-3fa9-a9cb-a8887f9c64ca",
                                        "entry_id": "eb74e826-570f-3efb-a1fa-1080e5f2b0ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a transition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77ef9c5c-e61a-3d14-ab3b-f8d2e9cd0760",
                                        "entry_id": "eb74e826-570f-3efb-a1fa-1080e5f2b0ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bring through a transition; to change."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31bc1a46-3287-485a-bbab-d377d3e01243",
                                                "sense_id": "77ef9c5c-e61a-3d14-ab3b-f8d2e9cd0760",
                                                "text": "The soldier was transitioned from a combat role to a strategic role."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50cb7024-a961-35b4-a77f-58f76983e1c7",
                                        "entry_id": "eb74e826-570f-3efb-a1fa-1080e5f2b0ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To change one's gender role or physical and sexual characteristics to conform to one's identified gender."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38d5f7a7-1eae-42a4-96a6-3b0e20231e5f",
                                                "sense_id": "50cb7024-a961-35b4-a77f-58f76983e1c7",
                                                "text": "Eric told me that after he transitioned, he wanted to learn to fish and all the things his father never taught him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12712a40-5730-47a4-8c11-3eaf9405533e",
                                                "sense_id": "50cb7024-a961-35b4-a77f-58f76983e1c7",
                                                "text": "And simply being accepted into one of these programs was not a guarantee that one would be allowed to transition. First, the trans person had to undergo extensive, sometimes indefinite, periods of psychotherapy […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6764df9e-c7ca-4641-b9e5-0ea939bd771c",
                                                "sense_id": "50cb7024-a961-35b4-a77f-58f76983e1c7",
                                                "text": "If the transitioning person leaves the family home, there will be moving costs, and costs associated with the acquisition of another home or the renting of an apartment. If the non-transitioning spouse leaves the family home, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39f4e216-893a-4378-a348-560e08bf88e0",
                                                "sense_id": "50cb7024-a961-35b4-a77f-58f76983e1c7",
                                                "text": "After he transitioned, he changed jobs so he could go stealth, hoping that no one would discover he was once a woman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01bc78a9-c43c-42e5-80fb-173a9ba96640",
                                                "sense_id": "50cb7024-a961-35b4-a77f-58f76983e1c7",
                                                "text": "Weimar Berlin. The first known case of a British person medically transitioning from one gender to another with the assistance of hormones and surgeries was Michael Dillon, a trans man (or 'female-to-male transsexual')."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ecb7d6e2-8095-4aac-962e-9c5990592a73",
                        "source_entry_id": "a9bf8c2b-e220-369e-ba1d-98a484daf9aa",
                        "source_sense_id": "93e0e76c-48fd-3c6d-b531-1f3c7be70f89",
                        "source_sense_description": "structurele overgang of omschakeling",
                        "target_lang_word": "transition",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "transition",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e392089a-3cc2-3d88-870e-a9c128fdce8e",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action, manière de passer d’un état à un autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88e356e8-3419-4fc9-8120-aea184211a1a",
                                                "sense_id": "e392089a-3cc2-3d88-870e-a9c128fdce8e",
                                                "text": "Un cloître est fort bien situé auprès d’une église ; il ménage heureusement la transition de la tranquillité du sanctuaire à l’agitation de la cité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e069425-0462-4d90-b24e-ce80639f7404",
                                                "sense_id": "e392089a-3cc2-3d88-870e-a9c128fdce8e",
                                                "text": "La transition displacive du titanate de strontium (SrTiO₃) est peut-être l’une des transitions de phase les plus étudiées en matière condensée depuis plus de 50 ans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87563f5f-cdb6-42f7-84e3-dd2c36053775",
                                                "sense_id": "e392089a-3cc2-3d88-870e-a9c128fdce8e",
                                                "text": "Ce processus est fondamental pour réaliser votre mue professionnelle, en quelque sorte votre « déscotchage », et pour assurer une transition réussie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c53f6758-9585-3c3a-aa43-cd09deb9cfd0",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Manière d'effectuer la liaison entre les parties d’un discours, d'un raisonnement, d’un ouvrage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd7765ae-8a36-428e-b2cd-57b88396138b",
                                                "sense_id": "c53f6758-9585-3c3a-aa43-cd09deb9cfd0",
                                                "text": "Transition heureuse, ingénieuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58d6b730-c44e-4e1b-a26e-e428de189e58",
                                                "sense_id": "c53f6758-9585-3c3a-aa43-cd09deb9cfd0",
                                                "text": "Il passe sans transition d’un sujet à un autre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d644c2f5-1df3-3a02-b0c3-6d12a52c4554",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Passage, pour le cheval, d'une allure à une autre. Les transitions peuvent être montantes (du pas au trot, du trot au galop), ou descendantes (galop-pas; trot-arrêt), en fonction que les allures s'intensifient ou se ralentissent. Elles sont dites \\\"intra-allures\\\", lorsqu'elles ne consistent qu'en une variation de la même allure (ex: transition du trot rassemblé au trot de travail, ou du trot de travail au trot allongé)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f2c4574-b057-3b3b-8d1f-7247da5c4fd3",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Remplacement, dans une chaîne normale d'acide désoxyribonucléique, de certaines bases par d'autres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23848669-610a-45d4-9a4c-2ed991f8be39",
                                                "sense_id": "5f2c4574-b057-3b3b-8d1f-7247da5c4fd3",
                                                "text": "La transition induite par certaines substances provoque un effet mutagène par \"transformation\" de la chaîne normale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f845cd2-05b7-3fe7-951b-8ab0991acf52",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Période intermédiaire entre deux styles biens représentatifs d'une tendance, d'une école..."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94df07ba-357a-4fc3-b006-bc268714ce46",
                                                "sense_id": "4f845cd2-05b7-3fe7-951b-8ab0991acf52",
                                                "text": "La transition du style roman au style gothique..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb4f63f8-2d96-3992-80d1-20285c5a8af8",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Passage d'un rythme, d'un ton, d'un mode à un autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0ac498c-02fe-4820-ac0d-c061affc1ed9",
                                                "sense_id": "cb4f63f8-2d96-3992-80d1-20285c5a8af8",
                                                "text": "Préparer une transition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4a44170-1a0d-34bd-8ef4-f15499dc1c2d",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Passage d’un régime politique, d’un état de choses, d'un ordre à un autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7afa3abc-e4f6-40a8-8586-33db7f9fa462",
                                                "sense_id": "c4a44170-1a0d-34bd-8ef4-f15499dc1c2d",
                                                "text": "Pourtant, le grand trouble qu’avait introduit dans son âme la révélation, sans transition, de ce pays si dissemblable au sien, se calmait lentement, mais sensiblement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38766b6d-3b46-45fa-856b-5dee9b849b02",
                                                "sense_id": "c4a44170-1a0d-34bd-8ef4-f15499dc1c2d",
                                                "text": "Ce découpage géographique n’a pas la prétention de définir exactement et sur le plan strictement scientifique les différents domaines chorologiques en particulier entre les domaines atlantique et médioeuropéen qui disposent, notamment en France, de larges zones de transition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6abe6d6-b1c9-46a0-af0b-21bcec72f015",
                                                "sense_id": "c4a44170-1a0d-34bd-8ef4-f15499dc1c2d",
                                                "text": "Déjà, l’obstination du président sortant le prive d’informations importantes et du budget pour préparer une transition dans les meilleures conditions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d18be458-1bbc-3ea4-aaa4-89cb983e5972",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dans la terminologie marxiste, phase de l’évolution d’une société, plus ou moins rapide et plus ou moins violente, préalable au communisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b76123b-3d46-4337-a8b2-ec3bd41d6588",
                                                "sense_id": "d18be458-1bbc-3ea4-aaa4-89cb983e5972",
                                                "text": "M. Proudhon, à cela près que M. Bray, loin de vouloir posséder le dernier mot de l’humanité, propose seulement les mesures qu’il croit bonnes pour une époque de transition entre la société actuelle et le régime de la communauté."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b812742-5403-3bfb-89e0-d5249fe9dc83",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dans les sports enchaînés (triathlon, duathlon…), changement de disciplines et donc d’équipements."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Triathlon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "005e60a4-b925-367a-b778-bcb5d865eea2",
                                        "entry_id": "b5b70f3c-2e2d-3959-b02b-fb97f1b77dce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Processus par lequel une personne change de catégorie sexuée — peut être sociale, médicale ou juridique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Transitude"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52f412fe-f1cf-4e79-90d4-800fdf0a3ba5",
                                                "sense_id": "005e60a4-b925-367a-b778-bcb5d865eea2",
                                                "text": "Il n’existe pas de transition parfaite, ni de parcours tout indiqué. ChacunE dispose librement de son corps et de son identité, et, de fait, du droit de les façonner comme elle/il l’entend, c’est-à-dire avec ou sans modifications corporelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39f3b5a2-ec8b-4188-a7d8-100120eb9ec0",
                                                "sense_id": "005e60a4-b925-367a-b778-bcb5d865eea2",
                                                "text": "Mais il faudrait distinguer un autre type de transphobie, \"institutionnelle\", celle-ci, et qui, en limitant l'accès au changement d'état civil et aux opérations remboursées, rend vulnérables l'ensemble des personnes souhaitant transitionner selon leurs propres modes de transition (chirurgicale, hormonale, nominale, etc.)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2698079-362b-4cf2-96fe-38eee2a788b7",
                                                "sense_id": "005e60a4-b925-367a-b778-bcb5d865eea2",
                                                "text": "[…], je me suis distraite de ma situation sinistre et calamiteuse en lisant un livre, un roman LGBT sur un homme qui fait sa transition pour devenir une femme, puis décide de redevenir un homme. J'aimais bien les histoires sur les gens qui changeaient d'avis et causaient ainsi leur propre perte même si, en l'occurrence, la détransition était certainement un cas assez rare, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ba4d316-6ad4-40e1-9c21-664ba0b82391",
                                                "sense_id": "005e60a4-b925-367a-b778-bcb5d865eea2",
                                                "text": "Souvent, la personne en transition modifie son apparence physique (habillement, maquillage, démarche), change son prénom et fait modifier des documents à valeur juridique. La transition peut parfois aussi comprendre une ou plusieurs interventions médicales qui permettront de modifier des aspects biologiques. La transition n'est pas une étape obligatoire à l'auto-identification comme personne transgenre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a70bbecd-404e-4231-9e57-8f6501dba978",
